  hintId: tutorial_terminal
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Terminal
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Terminal</b>


    The Terminal displays messages and information
    produced during program execution.


    You can display information in the Terminal
    using print().


    Example:


    print("Hello")


    The Terminal panel can
    be shown or hidden using the Terminal button.


    During tutorials, the system
    may also send important messages and guidance through the Terminal, so checking
    it regularly is recommended.'
  isImageBig: 0
